Output "scan.gif"
Set FontSize 22
Set Width 1200
Set Height 800
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "Monokai Soda"

Set Shell fish

Hide
Type "cd cmake-build-release"
Enter
Type "clear"
Enter
Show

Type "./main --scan ~/Music/titanic-rising"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Hide
Type "clear"
Enter
Show
Type "./main --list"
Sleep 2s
Enter
Sleep 5s